OL,3,GNEWSAM27 shut Whiteley-Portsmouth after
OL,4,Amotorcycle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M27 eastbound has been
OL,7,Fclosed following a crash.
OL,9,FThe motorway is shut between Whiteley
OL,10,Fat junction 9 and junction 12 for
OL,11,FPortsmouth. It was initially closed
OL,12,Ffrom junction 11 at Fareham. Lane three
OL,13,Fon the westbound carriageway is also
OL,14,Fclosed.
OL,16,FNational Highways said the crash
OL,17,Finvolving a motorcycle happened at
OL,18,Fabout 06:45 BST. It said plans were
OL,19,Funder way to release traffic within the
OL,20,Fclosure.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
