OL,3,GNEWSAM27 shut Whiteley-Portsmouth after
OL,4,Amotorcycle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being diverted off
OL,7,Feastbound at junction 9 and on to the
OL,8,FA27 towards Fareham. People are being
OL,9,Furged to allow extra time for their
OL,10,Fjourney, re-route or even delay their
OL,11,Ftrip.
